===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|fr|frm|grille}}, {{m|frm|grisle}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|greille}}, {{m|fro|graïlle}}, from earlier {{m|fro|gradilie}} (end of 10th century), from {{inh|fr|la|crāticula}} (or a {{inh|fr|VL.||graticula}}).

====Noun====
{{fr-noun|f}}

# [[gate]]
#: {{ux|fr|À huit heures et quart, on ferme la '''grille''' d’entrée de l’école.
|At 8:15, we close the school’s entrance '''gate'''.}}
# [[grate]]
#: {{ux|fr|La '''grille''' du barbecue est pleine de graisse de saucisses.
|The barbecue '''grate''' is covered in grease from the sausages.}}
# [[grid]]
#: {{ux|fr|Ci-joint la '''grille''' d’évaluation.
|Attachment: assessment '''grid'''.}}

